# CycleSignal AI — mobile client environment.
# Copy to `.env` (Expo auto-loads it). The ONLY client-side config is the backend
# URL. No API keys ever live in the app (PRD constraints #7/#8) — all third-party
# keys stay on the server (../server).

# Optional. Point the app at the CycleSignal backend proxy to enable the live AI
# integrations: Hume EVI 3 token, OpenAI symptom extraction, Gemini pattern
# narrative, and the Anthropic Claude Haiku 4.5 secondary safety classifier.
#
# Leave this UNSET to run fully on-device. The app degrades gracefully — the 60s
# demo runs with no backend, no keys, and no data leaving the phone.
#
# On a physical phone (Expo Go), use your computer's LAN IP, not localhost.
#   e.g. EXPO_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=http://192.168.1.50:8787
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=
